function populateFoundation(d){if(!d?.resolved){setText('ctxTerrainElevation','No stored sample');setText('ctxTerrainResolution','Foundation tile not resolved here');setText('ctxTerrainSource','BridgePoint national terrain');setText('ctxTerrainDatum','—');setText('ctxSurfaceMaterial','No stored sample');setText('ctxSurfaceClass','—');setText('ctxSurfaceSource','BridgePoint national surface');setText('ctxSurfaceVintage','—');return}const t=d.terrain||{},s=d.surface||{},sample=d.sample||{};setText('ctxTerrainElevation',t.elevation_m!=null?Number(t.elevation_m).toFixed(1)+' m':'—');setText('ctxTerrainResolution',t.resolution_m!=null?Number(t.resolution_m).toFixed(1)+' m source resolution':'25×25 frozen baseline sample · '+(sample.source_valid?'source-valid':'display-only'));setText('ctxTerrainSource',[t.source_provider,t.product_name].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')||'BridgePoint terrain baseline');setText('ctxTerrainDatum',t.vertical_datum||t.truth_class||'SOURCE-SAMPLED TERRAIN');setText('ctxSurfaceMaterial',s.material_label||'Class '+String(s.material_class??'—'));setText('ctxSurfaceClass',[s.source_class_system,s.raw_class!=null?'raw '+s.raw_class:null,s.material_class!=null?'normalized '+s.material_class:null].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')||'—');setText('ctxSurfaceSource',s.source_name||s.source_key||'BridgePoint surface baseline');setText('ctxSurfaceVintage',[s.source_year,s.source_native_resolution_m!=null?Number(s.source_native_resolution_m).toFixed(0)+' m native':null].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')||s.truth_class||'—')}
async function loadFoundation(lng,lat,seq){try{const d=await rpc('bridgepoint_public_foundation_sample_v5011',{p_lng:lng,p_lat:lat},2800);if(seq!==buildingRequestSeq)return;populateFoundation(d)}catch(e){if(seq!==buildingRequestSeq)return;setText('ctxTerrainElevation','Retry');setText('ctxTerrainResolution',String(e.message||e));setText('ctxSurfaceMaterial','Retry')}}

function contextAge(sec){const s=Math.max(0,Number(sec||0));if(s<90)return Math.round(s)+'s ago';if(s<5400)return Math.round(s/60)+'m ago';return Math.round(s/3600)+'h ago'}
function resetContext(){const feed=$('ctxFeed');if(feed){feed.textContent='CHECKING';feed.classList.remove('fresh')}setText('ctxUpdated','Verifying source freshness…');setText('ctxTerrainElevation','—');setText('ctxTerrainResolution','—');setText('ctxTerrainSource','—');setText('ctxTerrainDatum','—');setText('ctxSurfaceMaterial','—');setText('ctxSurfaceClass','—');setText('ctxSurfaceSource','—');setText('ctxSurfaceVintage','—');setText('ctxHazardCount','—');setText('ctxTruth','Only fresh, source-labelled records are shown.');const list=$('ctxHazardList');if(list)list.textContent=''}
function populateContext(d){const feed=d?.feed||{},fresh=feed.fresh===true,feedEl=$('ctxFeed');if(feedEl){feedEl.textContent=fresh?'LIVE · '+String(feed.fresh_sources||0)+'/'+String(feed.total_sources||0):'STALE · '+String(feed.fresh_sources||0)+'/'+String(feed.total_sources||0);feedEl.classList.toggle('fresh',fresh)}setText('ctxUpdated',feed.latest_success_at?'Latest source success '+new Date(feed.latest_success_at).toLocaleTimeString():'No source pulse available');const hazards=Array.isArray(d?.hazards)?d.hazards:[];setText('ctxHazardCount',String(hazards.length));const list=$('ctxHazardList');if(list){list.textContent='';if(!hazards.length){const empty=document.createElement('div');empty.className='hazard-item';const b=document.createElement('b');b.textContent='No fresh hazard records within '+String(d?.radius_km||50)+' km';const s=document.createElement('small');s.textContent=fresh?'Source feeds are current.':'Feed freshness is degraded; absence is not conclusive.';empty.append(b,s);list.appendChild(empty)}else for(const h of hazards.slice(0,8)){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='hazard-item';const top=document.createElement('div');top.className='hazard-top';const type=document.createElement('span');type.className='hazard-type';type.textContent=String(h.hazard_type||'HAZARD').replaceAll('_',' ');const sev=document.createElement('span');sev.className='hazard-severity';sev.textContent=String(h.severity||h.observation_kind||'SOURCE EVENT');top.append(type,sev);const title=document.createElement('b');title.textContent=h.headline||h.event_name||String(h.hazard_type||'Hazard');const meta=document.createElement('small');meta.textContent=[h.provider,h.distance_km!=null?Number(h.distance_km).toFixed(1)+' km':null,contextAge(h.freshness_seconds),h.observation_kind].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');row.append(top,title,meta);list.appendChild(row)}}setText('ctxTruth',d?.truth_notice||'Nearby hazards stay labelled as observations, alerts or forecasts.')}
async function loadContext(lng,lat,seq){try{const d=await rpc('bridgepoint_public_context_v5003',{p_lng:lng,p_lat:lat,p_radius_km:50},4200);if(seq!==buildingRequestSeq)return;populateContext(d)}catch(e){if(seq!==buildingRequestSeq)return;const feed=$('ctxFeed');if(feed){feed.textContent='RETRY';feed.classList.remove('fresh')}setText('ctxUpdated','Context refresh will retry · '+String(e.message||e))}}


